{"id":"s2.2.10","slug":"combinations-and-permutations","title":"Combinations and Permutations","content":"<p class=\"mb-4\">Combinations ($nC_k$) and Permutations ($nP_k$) are fundamental concepts in combinatorics.</p><ul class=\"list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 mb-4\"><li><strong>Permutations (order matters):</strong> $nP_k = \\frac{n!}{(n-k)!}$</li><li><strong>Combinations (order doesn't matter):</strong> $nC_k = \\frac{n!}{k!(n-k)!}$</li></ul><p class=\"mb-4\">Key identities include $nC_k = nC_{n-k}$ and $\\frac{nP_k}{nC_k} = k!$. It is also helpful to memorize factorials up to 10! for speed.</p>","summary":"Combinations () and Permutations () are fundamental concepts in combinatorics.","generation_guideline":"Generate a problem involving combinations (nCk) or permutations (nPk).","questions":[{"id":1,"text":"Calculate $5P_3$.","answer":"60","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic","bases","counting"]},{"id":2,"text":"Calculate $5C_3$.","answer":"10","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic","bases","counting"]},{"id":3,"text":"Calculate $6C_3$.","answer":"20","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic","bases","counting"]},{"id":4,"text":"Calculate $7C_4$.","answer":"35","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic","bases","counting"]},{"id":5,"text":"Calculate $7P_4$.","answer":"840","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic","bases","counting"]},{"id":6,"text":"Calculate $6P_2$.","answer":"30","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic","bases","counting"]},{"id":7,"text":"Calculate $8C_6$.","answer":"28","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic","bases","counting"]},{"id":8,"text":"Calculate $5C_2$.","answer":"10","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic","bases","counting"]},{"id":9,"text":"Calculate $8P_3$.","answer":"336","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic","bases","counting"]},{"id":10,"text":"Calculate $8C_3$.","answer":"56","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic","bases","counting"]},{"id":11,"text":"Calculate $9C_2$.","answer":"36","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic","bases","counting"]},{"id":12,"text":"Calculate $4P_2 \\div 4C_2$.","answer":"2","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic","bases","counting"]},{"id":13,"text":"Calculate $6P_3 \\div 6C_3$.","answer":"6","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic","bases","counting"]},{"id":14,"text":"Calculate $7P_4 \\div 7C_3$.","answer":"24","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic","bases","counting"]},{"id":15,"text":"Calculate $8C_5 \\div 8P_5$.","answer":"1/120","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic","bases","counting"]},{"id":16,"text":"Calculate $9P_3 \\div 9C_3$.","answer":"6","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic","bases","counting"]},{"id":17,"text":"Calculate $4P_3 \\div 3P_2$.","answer":"4","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic","bases","counting"]},{"id":18,"text":"Calculate $4C_3 \\times 3C_2$.","answer":"12","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic","bases","counting"]},{"id":19,"text":"Calculate $5P_3 \\times 4P_2$.","answer":"720","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic","bases","counting"]},{"id":20,"text":"Calculate $6C_3 \\div 6P_3$.","answer":"1/6","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic","bases","counting"]},{"id":21,"text":"Calculate $6C_1 + 4P_1$.","answer":"10","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic","bases","counting"]},{"id":22,"text":"Calculate $(5C_2)(5P_2)$.","answer":"200","kind":"exact","tags":["bases","counting"]}]}